# Hallmark

When the user asks to **build UI**, **redesign**, **audit design**, **study** a reference (screenshot/URL), or invokes **hallmark** by name:

1. Read and follow [`.cursor/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md`](../skills/hallmark/SKILL.md).
2. Load reference docs from `.cursor/skills/hallmark/references/` as the skill directs.

## Verbs

| Invocation | Action |
| --- | --- |
| *(default)* | New UI — macrostructure, theme, slop test, pre-emit critique |
| `hallmark audit <target>` | Score anti-patterns; punch list only — **no edits** |
| `hallmark redesign <target>` | New visual structure; keep copy, IA, routes unless user approves rebuild |
| `hallmark study <screenshot \| URL>` | Extract design DNA; never pixel-clone templates |

## Hope Sews + Hallmark

- **`media/`** stays source-only; never link in components.
- **Production assets** go through `npm run optimize:asset` into `public/` before use in pages.
- Do not delete routes or production files without explicit user approval (Hallmark safety rail + project rules).

